---
const layers = [
  {
    title: "01 程式結構",
    detail: "授權入口收斂資料存取，減少繞路",
    width: 860,
  },
  {
    title: "02 可執行檢查",
    detail: "跨租戶反例與依賴邊界，持續攔錯",
    width: 740,
  },
  {
    title: "03 文字與驗證技能",
    detail: "保留理由、操作步驟與可核對證據",
    width: 620,
  },
  { title: "04 人工判斷", detail: "決定需求、授權範圍與風險取捨", width: 500 },
];
---

<figure class="trust-diagram" aria-labelledby="trust-diagram-caption">
  <svg
    class="trust-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 540"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="trust-diagram-title trust-diagram-desc"
  >
    <title id="trust-diagram-title">把重複糾錯的投入往上移</title>
    <desc id="trust-diagram-desc"
      >四層由上而下逐漸收窄：程式結構、可執行檢查、文字與驗證技能、人工判斷。寬度表示投入優先順序，不代表量化比例。每一層仍然需要存在。</desc
    >
    <text x="480" y="36" text-anchor="middle" class="trust-diagram__lead"
      >讓下一個 PR 少依賴一次人的記憶</text
    >
    {
      layers.map((layer, i) => (
        <g transform={`translate(${(960 - layer.width) / 2}, ${64 + i * 116})`}>
          <rect
            class="trust-diagram__card"
            width={layer.width}
            height="96"
            rx="12"
          />
          <text
            x={layer.width / 2}
            y="34"
            text-anchor="middle"
            class="trust-diagram__title"
          >
            {layer.title}
          </text>
          <text
            x={layer.width / 2}
            y="66"
            text-anchor="middle"
            class="trust-diagram__detail"
          >
            {layer.detail}
          </text>
        </g>
      ))
    }
  </svg>
  <div class="trust-diagram__mobile">
    {
      layers.map((layer) => (
        <section class="trust-diagram__item">
          <>
            <strong>{layer.title}</strong>
            <p>{layer.detail}</p>
          </>
        </section>
      ))
    }
  </div>
  <figcaption id="trust-diagram-caption">
    四層投入優先順序。寬度是概念示意，沒有量測比例；上游攔住重複錯誤，人審保留無法機械判定的決策。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .trust-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  .trust-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .trust-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .trust-diagram__lead {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  .trust-diagram__title {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 800;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  .trust-diagram__detail {
    font-size: 15px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }
  .trust-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }
  .trust-diagram__item {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule-strong);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--dg-surface);
    color: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  .trust-diagram__item + .trust-diagram__item {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .trust-diagram__item p {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    color: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .trust-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .trust-diagram__mobile {
      display: block !important;
    }
  }
</style>
